{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-tourn-132"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-talk-403816700-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","missionId":"event-tourn-132","mission":"우인선","scene":"우인선","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 노잼 야수의 배 속에서 힘껏 헤엄치고 있다. 끝없이 넓은 차가운 바다 위에서 노잼 입자로 이루어진 위액이 물보라를 일으키며 당신의 콧구멍으로 들이닥친다","talkId":403816700,"textHash":"11085207471620677590","source":"tournHandBookEvent:132/talk-403816700","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"f150f191cc5decb5","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-talk-403816701-line"],"bwikiPage":"愚人船","bwikiRevision":95829,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14331","bwikiMission":"우인선"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-talk-403816701-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","missionId":"event-tourn-132","mission":"우인선","scene":"우인선","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"너덜너덜한 우인선이 당신 앞에 나타난다. 배의 뼈대는 썰렁한 농담이고, 돛은 진부한 우주 농담으로 되어 있다. 가면의 우인은 비속어 술잔을 높이 들고 함께 마시자며 당신을 배로 초대한다","talkId":403816701,"textHash":"2247132760117823187","source":"tournHandBookEvent:132/talk-403816701","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"f150f191cc5decb5","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-talk-403816702-line"],"bwikiPage":"愚人船","bwikiRevision":95829,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14331","bwikiMission":"우인선"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-talk-403816702-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","missionId":"event-tourn-132","mission":"우인선","scene":"우인선","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「어쩐지 출구가 안 보인다 했어. 딸꾹, 이 배는 노잼 야수의 배 속에 있는 거구나. 망할 것들… 바다 건너편에 삼진법 제국이 있다고 속이다니」 그는 누군가와 대화하듯 낮은 소리로 생각한다. 선실 안쪽에서 술집 같은 시끄러운 소리가 들려오지만, 당신은 문 뒤에 위액 표면에 떠 있는 웃음소리 말곤 아무것도 없다고 확신한다……","talkId":403816702,"textHash":"4550392087872952372","source":"tournHandBookEvent:132/talk-403816702","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"f150f191cc5decb5","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-talk-403816703-line"],"bwikiPage":"愚人船","bwikiRevision":95829,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14331","bwikiMission":"우인선"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-talk-403816703-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","missionId":"event-tourn-132","mission":"우인선","scene":"우인선","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「어디에 있는지 알면 쉬쉬, 쉽지」 취기가 가시지 않은 우인은 선미를 향해 걸어간다. 가면이 순식간에 수차례 바뀌더니, 갑자기 가속된 우인선은 위액 위에서 거대한 파도를 일으킨다","talkId":403816703,"textHash":"9762412059060663814","source":"tournHandBookEvent:132/talk-403816703","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"f150f191cc5decb5","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-talk-403816704-line"],"bwikiPage":"愚人船","bwikiRevision":95829,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14331","bwikiMission":"우인선"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-talk-403816704-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","missionId":"event-tourn-132","mission":"우인선","scene":"우인선","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「아, 잊고 마마, 말 안 했네. 이 배는 농담에 따라 방향을 바꾸거든. 딸꾹, 어떤 농담을 듣고 시시, 싶어?」 먼 곳의 새빨간 산맥이 점점 다가온다. 이 배가 위벽에 부딪히기 전에 당신은 이 주정뱅이가 뭐라도 말하게 해야 한다","talkId":403816704,"textHash":"709860627801253692","source":"tournHandBookEvent:132/talk-403816704","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"f150f191cc5decb5","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"愚人船","bwikiRevision":95829,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14331","bwikiMission":"우인선"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-text-9645501356445594245-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","missionId":"event-tourn-132","mission":"우인선","scene":"우인선","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"흉악한 가면의 농담","talkId":null,"textHash":"9645501356445594245","source":"tournHandBookEvent:132/text-9645501356445594245","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"fafba921d7a90995","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-text-7952322244051316318-effect"],"bwikiPage":"愚人船","bwikiRevision":95829,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14331","bwikiMission":"우인선"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-text-7952322244051316318-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","missionId":"event-tourn-132","mission":"우인선","scene":"우인선","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"미소를 부르는 기물 1개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"7952322244051316318","source":"tournHandBookEvent:132/text-7952322244051316318","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"fafba921d7a90995","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"愚人船","bwikiRevision":95829,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14331","bwikiMission":"우인선","bwikiReplyToIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-text-9645501356445594245-choice"]},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-text-16857181947027079916-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","missionId":"event-tourn-132","mission":"우인선","scene":"우인선","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"헤벌쭉 가면의 농담","talkId":null,"textHash":"16857181947027079916","source":"tournHandBookEvent:132/text-16857181947027079916","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"7bf43ef2370b010a","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"愚人船","bwikiRevision":95829,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14331","bwikiMission":"우인선"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-132-text-24820703030014342-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-132","missionId":"event-tourn-132","mission":"우인선","scene":"우인선","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"무도회 가면의 농담","talkId":null,"textHash":"24820703030014342","source":"tournHandBookEvent:132/text-24820703030014342","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"88c18fab6b87aa4f","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-1